3
00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:16.203
NARRATOR: Students will engage in activities
that show how computing changes the world and

4
00:00:16.203 --> 00:00:17.609
impacts daily lives.

5
00:00:17.609 --> 00:00:24.901
NARRATOR: Consider this worked case: Students
will examine a short case study of how

6
00:00:24.901 --> 00:00:30.109
