impact on daily life (e.g., healthcare,

9
00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:45.781
transportation, entertainment).

10
00:00:45.781 --> 00:00:52.078
NARRATOR: List the givens before choosing a
method, because an unstated assumption can

11
00:00:52.078 --> 00:00:53.531
change the conclusion.

12
00:00:53.531 --> 00:00:59.296
NARRATOR: This establishes the vocabulary and
scope needed for the remaining sections.

13
00:00:59.402 --> 00:01:04.673
NARRATOR: Now define Hardware-Software-Data
Relationship precisely enough that another

14
00:01:04.673 --> 00:01:07.602
