15
00:01:07.602 --> 00:01:14.742
NARRATOR: Expressions produce values, while
statements control execution and bindings.

16
00:01:14.742 --> 00:01:22.787
NARRATOR: Consider this worked case: Students
will trace how a simple calculator app uses

17
00:01:22.787 --> 00:01:29.683
