cause.

90
00:07:32.882 --> 00:07:38.807
NARRATOR: The diagnosis is strongest when
another person can reproduce the observation

91
00:07:38.807 --> 00:07:40.288
and the test.

92
00:07:40.394 --> 00:07:45.749
NARRATOR: Connect Communication and
Collaboration to the earlier ideas and explain

93
00:07:45.749 --> 00:07:49.156
