94
00:07:49.156 --> 00:07:54.520
NARRATOR: Students will be required to
demonstrate oral and written communication

95
00:07:54.520 --> 00:07:59.884
skills through such assignments as short
papers, homeworks, group discussions and

96
00:07:59.884 --> 00:08:03.297
